import Game.Levels.Warmup.L01_NameWhatYouHave

World "Warmup"
Title "What You Already Know"

Introduction "
This world assumes you have played the **Set Theory Game** by Daniel Velleman.

Nothing you proved there carries over automatically: each game on this server starts with an
empty inventory. So instead of asking you to prove those results again, this world *hands them
back* to you as tools, and then drills the moves you will need for topology: `exact`, `intro`,
`apply`, `rw`, `obtain`, and `have`, all on set membership.

There is no boss level here. This world is an on-ramp.
"
